                                "sense_id": "0a14a12b-2720-3795-bb57-eff8bcf751fc",
                                "text": "[…] a cotte of platte, a sallet, a halbert, a byll, sworde, and dager, 1l. 6s. 8d.; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfec6079-848c-4d24-a490-1197f75b502e",
                                "sense_id": "0a14a12b-2720-3795-bb57-eff8bcf751fc",
                                "text": "Two hundred half Lucoryes, half hundred English hupes, one bruing paune two smale paunes, one brass potte, five chests one trunke fiue brass candlesticks, two coops of platte, two Juells of gould two ringes of gould, two cupperts, tenn poundes worth of triffling in merchant ware, twelve poundes in money, seaven hundred sheepskins, two Spanis tables three quarter hundred Riess three barrells of beare malt twelve peeter dishes, two pattingers, two smale savcers with other smale trifflings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "340ba67a-0674-4e2b-a7bd-2db9b8244061",
                                "sense_id": "0a14a12b-2720-3795-bb57-eff8bcf751fc",
                                "text": "It[em] to severall platte cups and spoones / It[em] to severall pewter dishes"
